off 2 [0.33][2][2.50]
off 3 [0.333][2][2.500]
off 4 [0.3333][2][2.5000]
off 5 [0.33333][2][2.50000]
on  0 [0][2][3]
on  1 [0.3][2.0][2.5]
on  2 [0.33][2.00][2.50]
on  3 [0.333][2.000][2.500]
on  4 [0.3333][2.0000][2.5000]
on  5 [0.33333][2.00000][2.50000]
